    "description": {
      "value": "**Requirements:** You have a free hand.\n\nA palm-sized raw fruit or vegetable appears in your open hand.\n\nYou choose the specific type of food. A creature can consume the food with an Interact action to regain 3d10+12 Hit Points and be nourished as if it had eaten a meal. If uneaten, the food rots and crumbles to dust after 1 minute."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The Hit Points restored increase by 6."
    },
